{"ref":"BDB, שָׁכֵן","hw":"שָׁכֵן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁכֵן</span></big>  <strong>adj. inhabitant, neighbour</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.24\">Is 33:24</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:5\" href=\"/Hosea.10.5\">Ho 10:5</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֵנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:4\" href=\"/Exodus.12.4\">Ex 12:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֵנָ֑יִכְי֯</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.3\">2 K 4:3</a>, etc.; f. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֶנְתָּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:22\" href=\"/Exodus.3.22\">Ex 3:22</a>; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁכֵנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:17\" href=\"/Ruth.4.17\">Ru 4:17</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>inhabitant</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.24\">Is 33:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:5\" href=\"/Hosea.10.5\">Ho 10:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>neighbour:</em> woman <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:22\" href=\"/Exodus.3.22\">Ex 3:22</a> (E); pl. <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:17\" href=\"/Ruth.4.17\">Ru 4:17</a>; man <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:4\" href=\"/Exodus.12.4\">Ex 12:4</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.21\">Je 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.10\">Pr 27:10</a>, pl. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.3\">2 K 4:3</a>; of places <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.7\">Dt 1:7</a>; nations, to Judah <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.26\">Ez 16:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:12\" href=\"/Psalms.79.12\">ψ 79:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶרְפָּה לִשְׁכֵנֵי(נוּ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:14\" href=\"/Psalms.44.14\">44:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:4\" href=\"/Psalms.79.4\">79:4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:12\" href=\"/Psalms.31.12\">31:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:42\" href=\"/Psalms.89.42\">89:42</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מָדוֹן לשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:7\" href=\"/Psalms.80.7\">80:7</a>; to Edom <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.10\">Je 49:10</a>; to Sodom v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:40\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.40\">50:40</a>; to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.14\">11:14</a> (because to people).","next":"BDB, מִשְׁכָּן²","prev":"BDB, שֵׁ֫כֶן"}